                <invention-title lang="fr">APPAREIL ET PROCÉDÉ DE DÉCODAGE D'IMAGES ANIMÉES</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">VIDEO DECODING METHOD, VIDEO DECODING DEVICE</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A moving picture coding apparatus (100) includes: a motion vector predictor candidate calculation unit (114) which calculates motion vector predictor candidates and the number of motion vector predictor candidates; an inter prediction control unit (111) which selects an optimum motion vector predictor candidate; and a variable length coding unit (116) which sets the motion vector predictor candidate list size to the number of motion vector predictor candidates, and assigns a bit string according to the motion vector predictor candidate list size to a motion vector predictor index used for coding a motion vector, thereby performing variable length coding.</p>
            </abstract>
